And I have a twin brother, but he's currently in jail?

533
00:38:10.800 --> 00:38:12.609
And I'm busy to death trying to send him food?

534
00:38:12.610 --> 00:38:14.519
Want to find some time to go visit him in prison with me?

535
00:38:14.520 --> 00:38:15.490
You want me to say that?

536
00:38:16.800 --> 00:38:18.340
It's not wrong, though.

537
00:38:21.300 --> 00:38:24.500
But don't you think some guys might think like this?

538
00:38:25.010 --> 00:38:27.059
"Despite the difficult situation of coming from an orphanage..."

539
00:38:27.060 --> 00:38:28.639
"Even though her brother is locked up..."

540
00:38:28.640 --> 00:38:31.289
"She worked so hard at part-time jobs and got into college."

541
00:38:31.290 --> 00:38:32.679
"And takes such good care of her brother too."

542
00:38:32.680 --> 00:38:37.380
"She's a really cool and amazing girl."

543
00:38:43.200 --> 00:38:44.939
If you marry a guy like that...

544
00:38:44.940 --> 00:38:45.780
Then the bouquet...

545
00:38:47.440 --> 00:38:48.680
I'll catch it.

546
00:39:31.150 --> 00:39:35.259
(Yuseong Tech Study Group 5)
(Yoon Ga-min invited Kim Se-hyun)

547
00:39:35.260 --> 00:39:37.810
What the, where did you run off to, Kim Se-hyun?

548
00:39:38.660 --> 00:39:40.300
I went to cool off a bit.

549
00:39:41.980 --> 00:39:44.490
You absolutely have to hold the disciplinary committee, don't you?

550
00:39:45.060 --> 00:39:45.880
Yes.

551
00:39:46.410 --> 00:39:49.060
Once the handover is complete and the disciplinary committee is over...

552
00:39:49.550 --> 00:39:50.819
I will leave.

553
00:39:50.820 --> 00:39:53.899
Does it not matter even if those kids in the study group get hurt?

554
00:39:53.900 --> 00:39:57.190
If you were a real teacher, you should protect the students.

555
00:39:58.230 --> 00:40:02.490
My students aren't just the ones in the study group.

556
00:40:03.510 --> 00:40:08.460
I have already promised to protect all the students hurt by Pi Han-wool.

557
00:40:08.860 --> 00:40:13.670
For that, I still believe that Yuseong Tech needs to change.

558
00:40:14.060 --> 00:40:15.209
Teacher Lee Han-kyung.

559
00:40:15.210 --> 00:40:16.379
If...

560
00:40:16.380 --> 00:40:19.160
The kids in the study group really did something wrong,

561
00:40:19.630 --> 00:40:23.170
Then I will have them fairly accept their punishment and reflect on themselves.

562
00:40:24.130 --> 00:40:25.050
But...

563
00:40:28.790 --> 00:40:30.820
I won't stand by and let them be falsely accused.

564
00:41:01.610 --> 00:41:05.610
"Study Group"

565
00:42:15.680 --> 00:42:24.030
